## Cookies

Cookies are small files containing data that are commonly used as anonymous unique identifiers. They may be sent to your browser from websites you visit and stored on your device.

Core Manager does not explicitly use cookies within the mobile application. However, our website, third-party services, software development kits, or libraries integrated with the Service may use cookies or similar technologies to collect information and improve their services.

You may have the option to accept or refuse cookies and to be notified when a cookie is being sent to your device.

If you choose to refuse cookies, some portions or features of the Service may not function properly.

